  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COPOLAD II - COOPERATION PROGRAMME BETWEEN LATIN AMERICA, THE CARIBBEAN AND THE EUROPEAN UNION ON DRUGS POLICIES.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives and priorities of COPOLAD II will focus on the comprehensive, balanced and evidence-based approach to drugs issues, based on international cooperation and dialogue, as well as on demand and supply reduction, in line with the EU Drugs Strategy 2013-2020 and related Action Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
